r←ResolveHandler h;name;parts;repo;cls;nspath;repos;found;repoNs;members;hits;m
⍝ Resolve handler name to class reference.
⍝ Preferred format: "ClassName" (e.g. "Alisia", "GitHubHandler").
⍝ Legacy format "RepoName.ClassName" is accepted as fallback.
 name←' '~⍨h
 parts←('.'∘≠⊆⊢)name

⍝ Legacy explicit format: RepoName.ClassName
 :If 2=≢parts
      repo cls←parts
      nspath←'#.Handlers.',repo,'.',cls
      :If 0=#.⎕NC nspath
           ⎕SIGNAL/('Handler class not found: ',nspath)11
      :EndIf
      r←⍎nspath
      →0
 :EndIf

⍝ Simplified format: ClassName (search through loaded handler repos)
 cls←name
 :If 9≠#.⎕NC'#.Handlers'
      ⎕SIGNAL/('Handlers namespace not loaded: ',name)11
 :EndIf
 repos←#.Handlers.⎕NL ¯9
found←⍬
 :For repo :In repos
      repoNs←⍎'#.Handlers.',repo
      members←repoNs.⎕NL ¯9 ¯2
      hits←(⊂⎕C cls)=⎕C¨members
      :If ∨/hits
           :For m :In hits/members
                found,←⊂'#.Handlers.',repo,'.',m
           :EndFor
      :EndIf
 :EndFor
 :If 0=≢found
      ⎕SIGNAL/('Handler class not found: ',cls)11
 :EndIf
 :If 1<≢found
      ⎕SIGNAL/('Ambiguous handler class (multiple repos): ',cls,' -> ',∊found,¨⊂', ','. Use "RepoName.ClassName" in config, e.g. "Alisia.',cls,'"')11
 :EndIf
r←⍎⊃found
